One of the twelve went to the chief priests. His name was Judas Iscariot.
He asked, "What reward will I give you if you hand Jesus over to you?" They calculated thirty talents of silver for him.
From that time on, Judas watched for an opportunity to hand Jesus over to them. The Last Supper
